      <blockquote class="we-truncate we-truncate--multi-line we-truncate--interactive  we-customer-review__body" dir>
        

        <p dir="false" data-test-bidi>I buy by Visa but I didn’t received a coins since 5 days. I already sent an Email back and forth through Yalla support team with no action. How i can got my coins to my user account if no one from support team did their job. Till now the issue not resolved. Please advise.</p>
    


