  <div class="we-customer-review__header we-customer-review__header--user">
      <span class="we-truncate we-truncate--single-line  we-customer-review__user" dir="rtl">
    فلاح اليامي
</span>



    <span class="we-customer-review__separator">, </span>

    <time data-test-customer-review-date datetime="2018-12-18T03:17:04.000Z" aria-label="17 December 2018" class="we-customer-review__date" >17/12/2018</time>
  </div>

    <h3 class="we-truncate we-truncate--single-line  we-customer-review__title" dir="ltr" id="we-customer-review-3517">
    How
</h3>



      <blockquote class="we-truncate we-truncate--multi-line we-truncate--interactive  we-customer-review__body" dir>
        

        <p dir="false" data-test-bidi>How can i know the facebook account linked with my yalla live account?<br />I don’t know is there any support for this APP because i send request many requests to provide me facebook account linked with my yalla live account &amp; i don’t have option to see it throw APP !!<br /><br />Dear developer,<br /><br />This high importance &amp;urgent please i need to contact with you ?<br /><br />Bad App it doesn’t have support team more than one month there isn’t any body reply to me or close my request<br /><br />New note:<br />Why you don’t have authorized to see it you are support &amp; developer <br /><br />If you don’t have that add option to user to see the accounts linked with his App account<br /><br />My App account is under my mobile no but there is facebook account linked with it i need to know this facebook account!!!<br /><br />New note:<br />Ido not need to cancel facebook account i asked to provide me the facebook account linked with my yalla account !!!!<br /><br />New note:<br /><br />There isn’t response<br /><br />Update:<br /><br />للامانه.   تطبيق خايس ويفتقر للدعم الفني   لم تحل مشكلتي.   ومع كثر الالحاح مني والمتابعه تم حذف حسابي من قبلكم ودون علمي او طلب مني<br /><br />تطبيق ودعم فني لايستاهل التقييم</p>
    


<!----></blockquote>



      <h3 class="we-customer-review__header we-customer-review__header--response">
          <span class="we-truncate we-truncate--single-line  we-customer-review__title" dir="ltr">
    Developer Response
</span>



        <span class="we-customer-review__separator">, </span>

        
      </h3>

        <blockquote class="we-truncate we-truncate--multi-line we-truncate--interactive  we-customer-review__body" dir>
        

        <p dir="false" data-test-bidi>Please send more details about your user ID and screenshot to support@yalla.live, reset your password by mobile number, and we will cancel the link with Facebook account. We hope you enjoy with your friends in Yalla. <br />Warm Regards</p>
    


