 solved the problem of program crashes!\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-06-07\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-06-07T03:39:12Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.5.2\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Important update! We have solved the problem of program crashes!\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-03-07\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-03-07T14:51:46Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.5.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Important update! We have solved the problem of program crashes!\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-01-04\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-01-04T18:00:08Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.5.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Important update! We have solved the problem of program crashes!\",\"releaseDate\":\"2021-09-28\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2021-09-28T00:48:58Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.4.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Important update! We have solved the problem of program crashes!\",\"releaseDate\":\"2021-08-26\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2021-08-26T19:12:32Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.3.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"- We add global mode, you can see parties in your area default, but you can explore parties in other areas. \\n- Performance improvement\",\"releaseDate\":\"2021-07-16\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2021-07-16T17:15:32Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.2.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"- We add global mode, you can see parties in your area default, but you can explore parties in other areas. \\n- Performance improvement\",\"releaseDate\":\"2021-06-22\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2021-06-22T16:19:49Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.1.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"- A party now can be held in auto mode, when in this mode, everyone can hands up and take turns to speak. \\n- Performance improvement.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2021-06-10\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2021-06-10T22:35:09Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.0\",\"releaseNotes\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2021-06-02\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2021-06-02T10:09:42Z\"}],\"messagesScreenshots\":{},\"hasSafariExtension\":false,\"requiresGameController\":false,\"offers\":[{\"buyParams\":\"productType=C\u0026price=0\u0026salableAdamId=1562989000\u00